// The token the parser has consumed up to: advance keeps it, and every node
// made records the token before it as where the node came from, so a refusal
// can name file:line (front/diag/). dots is 1 from the `...` of a parameter
// list until the function type it ends is made. chk_flt is 1 once the check
// pass has refused a floating-point use in the function it is in.
